<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Harris Scarfe half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Harris Scarfe half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.37 vs   4.35</p>
<p>    Net					5.37 vs   4.35</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     7.0  vs   5.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  123.63 vs 138.21</p>
